{"ticker":"EW","updated":"2026-10-23T22:56:56Z","profile":{"longName":"Edwards Lifesciences Corporation","shortName":"Edwards Lifesciences Corporatio","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Devices","country":"United States","website":"https://www.edwards.com","fullTimeEmployees":16000,"marketCap":51339948032,"trailingPE":53.01786,"forwardPE":26.404646,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":7.8835354,"pegRatio":1.89,"targetMeanPrice":101.38556,"targetHighPrice":110.0,"targetLowPrice":84.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":27,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.136,"earningsGrowth":-0.254,"grossMargins":0.77839,"operatingMargins":0.29839,"profitMargins":0.15431,"totalRevenue":6512300032,"beta":0.864,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":96.29,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":74.66,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Edwards Lifesciences Corporation provides products and technologies to treat advanced cardiovascular diseases in the United States, Europe, Japan, and internationally. It offers transcatheter heart valve replacement products for minimally invasive replacement of aortic heart valves under the Edwards SAPIEN family of valves system; and transcatheter heart valve repair and replacement products to treat mitral and tricuspid valve diseases under the PASCAL and EVOQUE brands. The company also provides surgical structural heart solutions, such as aortic surgical valve under the INSPIRIS brand name; INSPIRIS RESILIA aortic valve, which offers RESILIA tissue and VFit technology; KONECT RESILIA, a pre-assembled tissue valve conduit for complex combined procedures; and MITRIS RESILIA valve. It distributes its products through a direct sales force and independent distributors. Edwards Lifesciences Corporation was founded in 1958 and is headquartered in Irvine, California.","summary_zh":"Edwards Lifesciences Corporation 在美國、歐洲、日本和國際上提供治療晚期心血管疾病的產品和技術。它提供經導管心臟瓣膜置換產品，用於 Edwards SAPIEN 系列瓣膜系統下的主動脈心臟瓣膜微創置換； PASCAL 和 EVOQUE 品牌的經導管心臟瓣膜修復和置換產品，用於治療二尖瓣和三尖瓣疾病。該公司還