WW9BR3ByeWZLLUMweUVZbkh1cVJMU2ZSTzhDRm15dmZqVEJ1N1JyaWM3WktRaEd0UHVHSVFZTlVPRW81b3A5MjB6cWhBNmYySUNmSXdnR1Bn?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"EW270617C00085000 互動式股票圖表 | EW270617C00085000 EW Jun 2027 85.000 看漲股票 - 雅虎財經"},{"title":"EW270115P00065000 interactive stock chart | EW Jan 2027 65.000 put stock - Yahoo Finance","src":"Yahoo Finance Singapore","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE44WTZMLTBSYlNYSkVGMHlqMzhzNDlkUWhBSVpYTWRFekJJTE9PMmppb3JNbXBSVHpTSUdsTVgweUh5eVNCc3ZIaWkzR3hSQ1JURXB2dEczWFcxR0NGZ2M1X0lR?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"EW270115P00065000 互動式股票圖表 | EW270115P00065000 EW Jan 2027 65.000 認沽股票 - 雅虎財經"}],"order_news":[],"themes":[{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-25","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1099800/000109980026000009/ew-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Edwards Lifesciences Corporation is the leading global structural heart innovation company, driven by a passion to improve patient lives. Through breakthrough technologies, world-class evidence, and meaningful partnerships with clinicians and healthcare stakeholders, our employees are inspired by our patient-focused culture to deliver life-changing innovations to those who need them most. Edwards Lifesciences has been a leader in our field for over six decades. Since our founder, Miles \"Lowell\" Edwards, first dreamed of using engineering to address diseases of the human heart, we have steadily built a company on the premise of imagining, building, and realizing a better future for patients.","zh":"Edwards Lifesciences Corporation 是全球領先的結構心臟創新公司，致力於改善患者的生活。透過突破性技術、世界級的證據以及與臨床醫生和醫療保健利益相關者的有意義的合作，我們的員工受到以患者為中心的文化的啟發，為最需要的人提供改變生活的創新。六十多年來，Edwards Lifesciences 一直是我們領域的領導者。自從我們的創辦人 Miles \"Lowell\" Edwards 首次夢想利用工程學來解決人類心臟疾病以來，我們就以想像、建設和實現患者更美好的未來為前提，穩步建立了一家公司。"},{"en":"Our innovative work encompasses both surgical and transcatheter therapies. In addition, our unique portfolio of repair and replacement technologies for aortic, mitral, tricuspid and pulmonic heart valves provides a broad set of treatment options to serve the many diverse and complex patients in need. Edwards remains committed to its strategy of transformative product innovation, high-quality, expansive clinical evidence to support approvals and adoption, as well as comprehensive support to ensure excellent real-world patient outcomes.","zh":"我們的創新工作包括手術和經導管治療。此外，我們獨特的主動脈瓣、二尖瓣、三尖瓣和肺動脈瓣修復和置換技術組合提供了廣泛的治療選擇，可以為許多有需要的多樣化和複雜的患者提供服務。 Edwards 仍然致力於其變革性產品創新策略、高品質、廣泛的臨床證據以支持批准和採用，以及全面的支持以確保出色的現實世界患者治療效果。"},{"en":"Cardiovascular disease is the number-one cause of death in the world and is the top disease in terms of health care spending in nearly every country. In the U.S. alone, one cardiovascular patient dies every 34 seconds.1 Cardiovascular disease is progressive in that it tends to worsen over time and often affects the structure of an individual's heart. Our vision is to transform patient care where patients are diagnosed earlier, treated in a routine fashion, live longer, and enjoy a better quality of life. Our future growth opportunities include offering solutions for treating patients with both valvular and non-valvular structural heart disease, such as heart failure, which is an unfortunate natural progression of the disease for many patients suffering from aortic stenosis, mitral and tricuspid regurgitation, and aortic regurgitation.","zh":"心血管疾病是世界上第一大死因，也是幾乎每個國家醫療支出最高的疾病。光是在美國，每 34 秒就有一名心血管患者死亡。 1 心血管疾病是進行性的，因為它會隨著時間的推移而惡化，並且經常影響個人心臟的結構。我們的願景是改變患者照護方式，讓患者更早得到診斷、接受常規治療、延長壽命並享受更好的生活品質。我們未來的成長機會包括為治療患有瓣膜和非瓣膜結構性心臟病（例如心臟衰竭）的患者提供解決方案，對於許多患有主動脈瓣狹窄、二尖瓣和三尖瓣逆流以及主動脈瓣逆流的患者來說，心臟衰竭是疾病的一種不幸的自然進展。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Our portfolio includes some of the most recognizable cardiovascular device product brands in treating structural heart disease today. We have a number of product lines that require sales and marketing strategies that are tailored to deliver high-quality, cost-effective products and technologies to customers worldwide. Because of the diverse global needs of the population that we serve, our distribution system consists of several direct sales forces as well as independent distributors. We are not dependent on any single customer and no single customer accounted for 10% or more of our net sales in 2025.","zh":"我們的產品組合包括當今治療結構性心臟病的一些最知名的心血管設備產品品牌。我們擁有許多需要量身訂製的銷售和行銷策略的產品線，以便為全球客戶提供高品質、具成本效益的產品和技術。由於我們服務的人群具有多樣化的全球需求，我們的分銷系統由多個直銷團隊和獨立分銷商組成。我們不依賴任何單一客戶，2025 年沒有任何單一客戶占我們淨銷售額的 10% 或以上。"},{"en":"To achieve optimal outcomes for patients, we conduct educational symposia and best practices training for our physician, hospital executive, service line leadership, nursing, and clinical-based customers. We rely extensively on our sales and field clinical specialist personnel who work closely with our customers in hospitals. Field clinical specialists routinely attend procedures where Edwards' products are being used in order to provide guidance on the use of our therapies, thereby enabling physicians and staff to reach expert proficiency and deliver differentiated patient outcomes. In addition to working closely with physicians, nurses, and other clinical personnel, our customers include decision makers such as service line leaders, material managers, biomedical staff, hospital administrators and executives, purchasing managers, and ministries of health. Also, where appropriate, our co","zh":"為了為患者實現最佳治療效果，我們為醫生、醫院管理人員、服務線領導、護理和臨床客戶舉辦教育研討會和最佳實踐培訓。我們廣泛依賴與醫院客戶密切合作的銷售和現場臨床專家。現場臨床專家定期參加使用 Edwards 產品的程序，以便為我們的療法的使用提供指導，從而使醫生和工作人員能夠達到專家水平並提供差異化的患者治療結果。除了與醫生、護士和其他臨床人員密切合作外，我們的客戶還包括服務線領導、材料經理、生物醫學人員、醫院管理人員和高階主管、採購經理和衛生部等決策者。此外，在適當的情況下，我們的合作夥伴"}],"competition":[{"en":"The medical technology industry is highly competitive. We compete with divisions of larger companies as well as smaller companies that offer competitive product lines in certain geographies in which we operate. We also compete with both established and newer technologies that address the patients served by our products. New product development and technological change characterize the areas in which we compete. Our present or future products could be rendered obsolete or uneconomical as a result of technological advances by one or more of our present or future competitors or by other therapies, including drug therapies. Our strategy is to develop and produce safe and effective therapies supported by high-quality clinical studies with extensive data and with innovative features that can enhance patient benefits and product performance and reliability, as well as benefit healthcare systems","zh":"醫療科技業競爭激烈。我們與大公司的部門以及在我們經營所在的某些地區提供有競爭力的產品線的小公司競爭。我們也與現有的和更新的技術競爭，這些技術可以滿足我們產品所服務的患者的需求。新產品開發和技術變革是我們競爭領域的特徵。由於我們現在或未來的競爭對手或其他療法（包括藥物療法）的技術進步，我們現在或未來的產品可能會過時或不經濟。我們的策略是開發和生產安全有效的療法，這些療法由高品質的臨床研究支持，具有廣泛的數據和創新功能，可以提高患者利益、產品性能和可靠性，並造福醫療保健系統"},{"en":"The cardiovascular segment of the medical technology industry is dynamic and subject to significant change due to cost-of-care considerations, regulatory reform, industry and customer consolidation, and evolving patient needs. The ability to provide products and technologies that demonstrate value while improving clinical outcomes is becoming increasingly important for medical technology manufacturers.","zh":"醫療技術行業的心血管領域是動態的，並且由於護理成本考慮、監管改革、行業和客戶整合以及不斷變化的患者需求而可能發生重大變化。對於醫療技術製造商來說，提供具有價值的產品和技術並同時改善臨床結果的能力變得越來越重要。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"United States","val":3543100000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Europe","val":1517500000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Rest Of World","val":652300000,"zh":"世界其他地區部門"},{"name":"Japan","val":354700000,"zh":"日本"}],"total":6067600000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Transcatheter Aortic Valve Replacement","val":4487700000,"zh":"經導管主動脈瓣置換術"},{"name":"Surgical Heart Valve Therapy","val":1029300000,"zh":"心臟瓣膜手術治療"},{"name":"Transcatheter Mitral & Tricuspid Therapies","val":550600000,"zh":"經導管二尖瓣和三尖瓣治療"}],"total":6067600000}},"peers":["BAX","BSX","RMD","SYK","BDX"]}}